# Changelog

## 1.16.4
- Set the required memory limit to 4 GiB.

## 1.16.3
- Require Cloudron authentication before granting access to OpenHands.

## 1.16.2
- Use the upstream image's available `runuser` utility when dropping privileges.

## 1.16.1
- Run the application as the Cloudron user so `/app/data` is writable.

## 1.16.0
- Initial Cloudron package for OpenHands Agent Canvas.

## Next release notes
- Keep the packager display name generic; never add a personal full name.
- Preserve the required `packageUrl`, `packagerUrl`, and Docker Hub image references.
- Bump `version` in `CloudronManifest.json`, the version key in `CloudronVersions.json`, and the Docker image tag together.
